#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1470 expect=skipped domain=VS
#note "Scope.Domains.Include: [LB] rejects the dataset at the scenario pre-gate, so the rule never runs. Pins the LB domain gate ONCE for the three SD rules in this batch (SD1470, SD1471, SD1473), which carry the identical Scope block."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset VS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col VSSEQ    type=Num
col VSTESTCD type=Char
col VSORRES  type=Char
col VSORNRLO type=Char
---
S1 | VS | 001 | 1 | SYSBP | POSITIVE | 90
---
